{"schema":"adr-lifecycle/v1","event":"acceptance","adr":"0020-recovery-safe-battle-console-loading","recorded_at":"2026-10-30T13:51:57.226635+00:00","source_commit":"24c79505cf3fff85834058dda3f2eb58c060a592","blob_sha256":"2901228548adcf85c5b25f7455a3a3f47d09180ba7445b2ec6540bd041d64143","body_sha256":"44e9f4f1725b715dd8e3248eb1e583529bfaa02e5663ad62184d4b317784a0e1","obligations":[{"id":"0020-recovery-safe-battle-console-loading.1","section":"Decision","text":"Include the battle-console semantic UI in the startup import graph so an already-open game does not depend on a later semantic-control chunk download after deployment.","text_sha256":"4c660d8b70c38b307de8358b5311ad6d3bde9416c2bb33967a1f92891bf55b6e"},{"id":"0020-recovery-safe-battle-console-loading.2","section":"Decision","text":"Mount, update and destroy the semantic tree through the existing battle lifecycle; startup code availability does not mount battle controls on lobby or account routes.","text_sha256":"b2e1f9acb8af199fd2fc70f4c51618aebae67760763bb8acc512b5b05a60e58a"},{"id":"0020-recovery-safe-battle-console-loading.3","section":"Decision","text":"Keep Pixi lazy and non-interactive, with complete usable semantic controls when optional visual loading fails.","text_sha256":"2b8fdbb30302a0db728d149145b3474331fd0c439ed413a783c766ad8ae2cc2f"},{"id":"0020-recovery-safe-battle-console-loading.4","section":"Decision","text":"Supersede only ADR-0018's requirement that Preact load lazily on battle entry. Retain its single semantic owner, typed state and intents, Canvas2D world authority, accessibility and static-hosting boundaries.","text_sha256":"b2441aedd82d00ede7355b60c0bac48a18102000e23289530a370aa41426d6de"}],"obligations_sha256":"aba9bb95821ca400e18c912d33126bb81eec053b1bda509335feb42ae146b3a8","obligations_sealed":true}
